      "why_read": "Read this to understand how to efficiently process and decompose vast quantities of raw log data into structured, LLM-ready patterns. You will learn about a tool that extracts meaningful insights such as typed variables, quantiles, and anomalies from noisy log lines.",
      "authors": [
